{"suttaId":"tha-ap498","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-ii","vriCode":"s0510m2.mul","paras":[2652,2681],"vripara":"41"},"segments":{"tha-ap498:0.3":"Ghatamaṇḍadāyakattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap498:1.1":"“Sucintitaṃ bhagavantaṃ, lokajeṭṭhaṃ narāsabhaṃ;","tha-ap498:1.3":"Upaviṭṭhaṃ mahāraññaṃ, vātābādhena pīḷitaṃ.","tha-ap498:2.1":"“Disvā cittaṃ pasādetvā, ghatamaṇḍamupānayiṃ;","tha-ap498:2.3":"Katattā ācitattā [upacitattā (syā. ka.)] ca, gaṅgā bhāgīrathī ayaṃ.","tha-ap498:3.1":"“Mahāsamuddā cattāro, ghataṃ sampajjare mama;","tha-ap498:3.3":"Ayañca pathavī ghorā, appamāṇā asaṅkhiyā.","tha-ap498:4.1":"“Mama saṅkappamaññāya, bhavate madhusakkarā [madhusakkharā (syā. ka.)];","tha-ap498:4.3":"Cātuddīpā ime rukkhā, pādapā dharaṇīruhā.","tha-ap498:5.1":"“Mama saṅkappamaññāya, kapparukkhā bhavanti te;","tha-ap498:5.3":"Paññāsakkhattuṃ devindo, devarajjamakārayiṃ.","tha-ap498:6.1":"“Ekapaññāsakkhattuñca, cakkavattī ahosahaṃ;","tha-ap498:6.3":"Padesarajjaṃ vipulaṃ, gaṇanāto asaṅkhiyaṃ.","tha-ap498:7.1":"“Catunnavutito [chanavute ito (sī.)] kappe, yaṃ dānamadadiṃ tadā;","tha-ap498:7.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, ghatamaṇḍassidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap498:8.1":"“Kilesā jhāpitā mayhaṃ … pe … viharāmi anāsavo.","tha-ap498:9.1":"“Svāgataṃ vata me āsi … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ.","tha-ap498:10.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap498:11.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā ghatamaṇḍadāyako thero imā gāthāyo Abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap498:12.1":"Ghatamaṇḍadāyakattherassāpadānaṃ chaṭṭhaṃ."},"attha":null,"tika":null}
